### ============================================
### 文章管理模块测试 (vellastra-article :8083)
### ============================================

### 1. 创建文章
# @name createArticle
POST http://localhost:8080/article
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试文章标题",
  "content": "# 这是文章内容\n\nMarkdown 格式内容",
  "summary": "文章摘要",
  "coverImage": "https://example.com/cover.png",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "status": 0
}

> {% client.global.set("articleId", response.body.data); %}

### 2. 文章详情
GET http://localhost:8080/article/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 更新文章
PUT http://localhost:8080/article/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新后的标题",
  "content": "# 更新后的内容",
  "summary": "更新摘要",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "status": 0
}

### 4. 分页列表
GET http://localhost:8080/article?current=1&size=10&categoryId=&keyword=&authorId=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 发布文章
PATCH http://localhost:8080/article/{{articleId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 撤回发布
PATCH http://localhost:8080/article/{{articleId}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 置顶
PATCH http://localhost:8080/article/{{articleId}}/top?top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 浏览计数
POST http://localhost:8080/article/{{articleId}}/view
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 点赞
POST http://localhost:8080/article/{{articleId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1

### 10. 最新文章
GET http://localhost:8080/article/latest?size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 批量操作 - 发布
POST http://localhost:8080/article/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [{{articleId}}],
  "action": "publish"
}

### 12. 仪表盘数据
GET http://localhost:8080/article/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 删除文章
DELETE http://localhost:8080/article/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
